  "question": {
    "text": "Given below are two statements :\nStatement (I) : NaCl is added to the ice at $0^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$, present in the ice cream box to prevent the melting of ice cream.\nStatement (II) : On addition of NaCl to ice at $0^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$, there is a depression in freezing point.\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
